  "question": {
    "text": "If two different numbers are taken from the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>; then the probability that their sum as well as absolute difference are both multiple of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>, is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5AVS7",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>55</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
