  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Required favourable cases are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, favourable cases <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Total cases <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the required probability <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>55</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
